  "notes": "Dark cinematic Atlanta trap. An 1/8 hat bed rather than a carpet, with 1/16 and 1/32 rolls and triplet bursts over it; layered snare and clap on 3, sharp and dry; a sparse syncopated kick locked hard to the 808, which carries the chord roots and slides into downbeats. ⚠ `anticipationProb` raised to 0.15. With `mirror_kick` against a fully locked 808 both parts take every kick, so every bass onset lands exactly on an 808 onset — `coherence.rs` calls that one line played twice rather than two parts locking. The lock is the style and is untouched; the anticipation is what makes them two parts.",
